  "title": "Cheese and Garden Vegetable Pie",
  "description": "Chop the veggies, mix with mayonnaise, crumbled bacon, and cheese, and then toss the mixture into a deep dish pie shell and bake. Slice hearty pie into big hunks and serve it with garlic mashed potatoes.",
